      "text": " <think>\nTo find the sum of 113208723 and 927342927, we can follow these steps:\n\n1. Align the numbers by their place values: \n   ```\n   113208723\n   +927342927\n   ```\n\n2. Add the digits starting from the rightmost column (units place):\n   ```\n   3 + 7 = 10\n   Write down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n   ```\n   ```\n   3 + 7 = 10\n   Write down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n   ```\n   ```\n   2 + 2 = 4\n   ```\n   ```\n   8 + 9 = 17\n   Write down 7 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n   ```\n   ```\n   0 + 3 = 3\n   ```\n   ```\n   2 + 4 = 6\n   ```\n   ```\n   3 + 7 = 10\n   Write down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 2 = 3\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 2 = 3\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 9 = 10\n   Write down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 9 = 10\n   Write down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\n   ```\n   1 + 1 = 2\n   ```\