      "text": " <think>\nTo find the sum of 395520983 and 794083008, we can follow these steps:\n\n1. Align the numbers by their place values: \n   ```\n   395520983\n   +794083008\n   ```\n\n2. Add the digits starting from the rightmost column (units place):\n   ```\n   3 + 8 = 11\n   Write down 1 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n   ```\n   ```\n   1\n   11\n   ```\n\n3. Move to the next column (tens place):\n   ```\n   8 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 9\n   Write down 9.\n   ```\n   ```\n   9\n   11\n   ```\n\n4. Continue this process for each column moving from right to left:\n   ```\n   0 + 3 = 3\n   2 + 8 = 10\n   Write down 0 and carry over 1.\n   ```\n   ```\n   0\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   9\n   10\n   1\n   ```\n\n   ```\n   10\n   10\n